WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.850
Hey there!

00:01.000 --> 00:03.700
Got something in your community
you wish worked better?

00:04.120 --> 00:07.450
Good! That's exactly where
great solutions start.

00:07.820 --> 00:09.650
Just type it in. One sentence.

00:10.000 --> 00:12.750
No account, no team,
no perfect wording.

00:13.280 --> 00:15.700
Bucky will help you shape it
into a clear brief:

00:16.000 --> 00:18.950
who's affected, why it matters,
and what could change.

00:19.440 --> 00:20.700
Then, when you're ready,

00:20.860 --> 00:24.400
take it all the way into a full
Global Solutions Lab project.

00:24.860 --> 00:26.400
So, what would you change?

00:26.680 --> 00:27.760
Start now!
